  "description": {
    "text": "The 2005 Pokémon World Championships, held from 19 to 21 August 2005 at the Town and Country Resort and Convention Center in San Diego, with about 434 players. Each competitor got Tropical Tidal Wave in seven languages, with two inserts, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing, now from Top Thirty-Two up to Finalist; staff got a Staff copy. Championship Arena was a surprise gift slipped under competitors' hotel room doors.\n\nThe top three of each age division received No. 1 to No. 3 Trainer trophy cards.",
